### Database Drills API Tests

### Drill Set 2: Users
# @name createUser
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

### Drill Set 2: Get All Users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### Drill Set 2 & 3: Create Task
# @name createTask
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn PostgreSQL",
  "user_id": 1
}

### Drill Set 3: Read Tasks (All)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks

### Drill Set 3: Read Tasks (Filtered by Completion)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks?completed=false

### Drill Set 3: Update Task (Mark Complete)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}

### Drill Set 4: Get Tasks with User Emails (JOIN)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/detailed

### Drill Set 5: Test Constraint Violation (Empty Title)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "user_id": 1
}

### Drill Set 5: Test Unique Constraint (Duplicate Email)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

### Drill Set 3: Delete Task
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/1
